1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Create an inputs sheet for units, price per unit, and cost per unit.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Revenue is units multiplied by price, and cost is units multiplied by cost per unit.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Gross profit subtracts cost from revenue, and gross margin divides gross profit by revenue.
